    "Id": "chassisdef_talos_TLS-QSK",
    "Name": "Talos",
    "Details": "Tired of pesky Battle Armor ruining your day? Blast them away with our LBX PPCs! To that end we present the TLS-QS, designed to provide deterent with our custom LRM15 launchers designed not to hit your target with fancy sensors, but to blow up the ground they need to get to you! If that fails you can just burn nice little holes in they're fancy armor! Shoo little toads!\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Easy to Pilot</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.04</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limit: Right Lower</color>",
